{"parentUuid":"9d02c7e3-ea80-444b-8853-a4cf50d2ef90","isSidechain":false,"userType":"external","cwd":"/app/workspace","sessionId":"dee3225b-eff8-47b6-889d-57d37ff3ee20","version":"2.1.19","gitBranch":"","slug":"refactored-napping-crown","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01TkGmCxm71zHKyEnZgG59Q2","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The implementation is complete. Here's a summary of what was implemented:\n\n## Files Created/Modified\n\n### New files:\n1. **`src/main/java/clusterdata/datatypes/TaskEvent.java`** - Task event data type with fields: `timestamp`, `jobId`, `taskIndex`, `eventType`. Includes CSV parsing from the Google Cluster Data format (13-column CSV).\n\n2. **`src/main/java/clusterdata/datatypes/JobEvent.java`** - Job event data type with fields: `timestamp`, `jobId`, `eventType`. Includes CSV parsing from the Google Cluster Data format (8-column CSV).\n\n### Modified:\n3. **`src/main/java/clusterdata/query/LongestSessionPerJob.java`** - The main Flink job implementation.\n\n## Architecture\n\nThe job uses a three-stage pipeline:\n\n1. **Task SUBMIT event processing**: Reads the gzipped task events CSV, filters for SUBMIT events (eventType=0), assigns event-time watermarks (converting microsecond timestamps to milliseconds), then applies **EventTimeSessionWindows** with a configurable gap (default 600 seconds / 10 minutes) keyed by `jobId`. Each session window outputs `(jobId, taskCount)`.\n\n2. **Job FINISH event processing**: Reads the gzipped job events CSV, filters for FINISH events (eventType=4), converts to `(jobId, -1)` tuples as finish markers.\n\n3. **Join via `KeyedCoProcessFunction`**: Connects both streams keyed by `jobId`. Accumulates the maximum stage count from session window results and tracks job finish signals. Uses an event-time timer at `Long.MAX_VALUE - 1` to ensure output is only emitted after all session windows have fired (when bounded sources complete and watermarks reach max).\n\nOutput format: `(jobId,maxStageCount)` — one line per finished job."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":314,"cache_read_input_tokens":88179,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":314,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1}},"requestId":"req_vrtx_011CXtACv9jRgHMZHdRLSoJa","type":"assistant","uuid":"24f86f8a-92e8-45b8-ac7d-b0d0d44fdda8","timestamp":"2026-02-07T05:30:56.412Z"}
